&error_wrong_pass_text_allow_correction�パスワードが却下されました。他のデバイスで変更された可能性があります。現在のパスワードを入力してください。error_character_already_added�<red>このキャラクターは既にこのデバイスに追加されています！</red><br><br>"戻る"をクリックしてキャラクター選択に戻ってください。album_ach_083_textCギャンブラーでサイコロ5個の同じアイコンを出すevent_description_blacksmith�<li>クエストでメタルや神秘な断片が見つかる</li><li>ブラックスミスでアイテムを分解すると獲得するポイントが%2から%1になる</li><li>ギャンブラーの神秘な断片が%3倍</li><li>ルーレットの神秘な断片が%4倍</li>event_description_epic_gamble�<li>ギャンブラーからエピックアイテム獲得の確率あり</li><li>ルーレットからのエピックアイテム獲得率が上昇</li>event_description_fortress�<li>クエストで木材や石材が見つかる</li><li>宝石鉱山の宝石が全部サイズ大</li><li>部隊の訓練時間が半減</li><li>ギャンブラーの木材や石材が%1倍</li><li>ルーレットの木材や石材が%2倍</li>event_description_hourglass�<li>魔法店の砂時計が10倍増加</li><li>ギャンブラーの砂時計が%1倍</li><li>砂漠地帯の各クエストで砂時計を収集</li>event_description_underworld�<li>クエストで魂が見つかる</li><li>ヒーローをあの世に誘い込むと魂%1倍</li><li>魂抽出装置から集まる魂が%2倍</li><li>ギャンブラーの魂が%3倍</li><li>ルーレットの魂が%4倍</li>class_info_5GFlings an Arcane Comet at the opponent at the beginning of each battle.old_game_worldsOld game worldsmax_pinned_battles_reached5The maximum number of pinned fights has been reached!earn_mushroomsEarn mushroomsbattle_mage_attack_infoKBefore each fight the Arcane Comet deals some extra damage to the opponent.battle_mage_info_comet_text�The Arcane Comet deals damage to your enemy depending on your hit points and the class of your enemy. The resulting damage is never higher than %1% of your enemy's <hp> hit points.battle_mage_info_gauntlet_text�At the start of the battle, your Arcane Gauntlet unleashes the power of the Arcane Comet that hits your enemy. The damage of this attack depends on your hit points and your enemy's class.<br><br>The Arcane Energy Flows strengthen your attributes by %1% and protect you especially well against attacks.bard_info_melody_text�You play your harp every %1 combat rounds.<br><br>Your melody, however, will be ineffective in fights against <info>Mages</info><br><br>Your melody has 3 quality levels, depending on the quality level the positive effect of the melody is enhanced.<br>Chance for the respective quality levels:<br><li>Level 1: %2%</li><li>Level 2: %3%</li><li>Level 3: %4%</li>Each melody can be of different length, a melody can last %5 - %6 rounds, your <info>constitution</info> attribute influences the length of the melody.gt_info_general_text�You need <info>Key Cards</info> to operate the hellish elevator and access each floor.<br><br>Every %1 hours, the Hellevator goes up %2 floors, allowing you to defeat enemies on those floors again. Defeated enemies drop useful loot as well as exclusive <info>Hell Tokens</info>. Together with the <info>Hell Tokens</info> of your guild mates, you'll earn more chests full of resources. Once the Hellevator closes and the event ends, additional rewards will be credited based on the achieved guild rank.gt_tutorial_text_05�After the Hellevator has closed, all members of guilds that participated will receive a reward. It will depend on your guild's Hellevator rank in the game world and scales with your level. You can view at any time the rank of your guild in the Hellevator in the <info>guild rankings</info>. <br><br>You can collect your reward up to %1 days after the Hellevator has closed. It doesn't matter when you claim your reward. That reward will be determined upon closure. <br><br>The three guilds with the most Hell Tokens in a game world will also receive a <info>very special profile background</info> which lasts until the start of the next Hellevator.old_password現在のパスワードdamage_multiplierDamage factorarmor_multiplierArmor factorlife_multiplierHit points factorbard_info_text�As a Bard your damage in battle depends on your <info>intelligence</info> attribute. The melody your harp plays gives you a positive effect in battle.druid_info_text�As a Druid your damage in battle depends on your <info>intelligence</info> attribute. The abilities of your animal forms help you in battle.bard_info_melodyMelodydealer_legal_cancellation2<link:cancellation>契約解除ポリシー</link>battle_mage_info_comet_titleArcane Cometgt_tutorial_text_07�ベルゼブブは、ヘレベーターの進み具合によってあなたとあなたのギルドメンバーに<info>毎日</info>報酬を与えてくれる。その日に集めた地獄のトークンの数によって、報酬の宝箱を受け取ることができる。<br>入手できる宝箱には3種類存在する：<br><br><li>木と石が詰まったフォートレスの宝箱。</li><br><li>金属と神秘な断片が詰まったブラックスミスの宝箱。</li><br><li>驚くほどのゴールドが詰まってゴールドの宝箱。</li><br>プレイ時間外に入手した宝箱は、次の日に受け取ることができる。プレイヤーとギルドは合計で1日、%1個の宝箱を入手可能。battle_mage_info_gauntlet_titleArcane Gauntletclass_info_8"Takes the form of a bear or eagle.dot_info�This is the <info>Legendary Dungeon</info>. In %1 rooms spread over %2 floors nasty monsters and treacherous traps await you, but also glorious rewards. Defeat the four bosses and receive a Legendary item at the end!dot_info_keys_text�When you are in the Legendary Dungeon, you will see that some <info>locked doors</info> block your way, but don't worry. Every monster defeated in the Legendary Dungeon has a chance to have a key in their pockets.<br><br>Keys are also used as currency by the <info>Key Master</info>. With him you can trade keys for temporary blessings in the Legendary Dungeon. In contrast to this, the Key to Failure Shop Master will trade his found keys for temporary curses.dot_info_buffs_debuffs_text�As you run through the dungeon, you may receive a curse or a blessing. These are displayed <info>above your hit points bar</info> and can significantly affect your progress through the dungeon! However, they will only last for a certain number of rooms.<br><br>You can get curses and blessings in different ways, for example from <info>barrels or chests</info>. Special <info>cursed doors and chests</info> will cast a random curse on you when touched, and special rooms will also give you a curse or blessing depending on your interaction. Moreover, <info>monsters</info> from the second floor onwards can curse you with their attacks. Which curse from monsters you can suffer on which floor can be seen on the overview map.gt_daily_text�<info>%1フロア</info>まで引かれます。戦闘へ！<br><br><info>ベルゼブブのエンポリアム</info>では、<info>新しい商品</info>が買え、<info>地獄のトークンコレクションキャンペーン</info>は<info>リセット</info>されます。dot_info_general_text�You can earn loot such as epic items, gold, or other resources by slaying monsters or opening treasure chests on %1 different floors. At the end of each floor, you’ll encounter a big ol' baddie. Defeat the final boss in room %2 and receive a <info>Legendary item</info> in normal mode or <info>3 Legendary items</info> in <info>Legendary Dungeon Ultimate</info> mode. This will reset the Legendary Dungeon again so you can conquer it anew to collect more Legendary items.gt_info�This is the Hellevator, an elevator that leads directly into the depths of the underworld. Fight against <info>%1 enemies of increasing strength</info> and climb up together with your guild the <info>rankings</info>.percentage_enemy_hp%1% <hp><br> of the enemydive_attack_damage_bonus#急襲ダメージボーナス：%1bard_tutorial_text_2�Your melody has 3 quality levels, depending on the quality level the positive effect of the melody is enhanced.<br>Chance for the respective quality levels:<br><li>Level 1: %1%</li><li>Level 2: %2%</li><li>Level 3: %3%</li>Each melody can be of different length, a melody can last %4 - %5 rounds, your <info>constitution</info> attribute influences the length of the melody.abilityAbilityitem_type_03_class_2_pic_068�Charming Tailcoat|"Whether for a fight or a spontaneous date -<br>is guaranteed to turn the other person's head."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!armor_classArmor classweapon_classWeapon classvaluesValuesinfoInfoitem_type_09_pic_068�Ring of Eternal Promise|"Love can't be measured in values, but this<br>bling still sparkles quite nicely!"<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_07_class_1_pic_068SHeart Holder|"So that your heart doesn't sink so easily."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_05_class_1_pic_106aArmed Hands|"Who needs gloves when you<br>can use a pair of extra hands<br>to attack right away?"druid_info_shapes_text�As a druid, you have the ability to transform into different animal forms in battle.<br><br>Instead of a normal attack, you can quickly transform into an eagle and perform a powerful swoop (base chance %1%). Afterwards, you immediately transform back.<br><br>You also have the ability to evade attacks (%2% chance). After doing this, you transform into a bear and enter Rage. In this form you cannot evade or perform a swoop. You remain in this bear form for one round and then change back.battle_mage_info_titleThe Battle Magebattle_mage_info_text�As a Battle Mage, your damage in battle depends on your <info>strength</info> attribute. Your training allows you to use the Arcane Gauntlet to your advantage.
max_damageMax. damagepercentage_damagePercentage damagenew_dungeon_key_found_info_textYCongratulations! You have found a key, and a new dungeon opens its massive doors for you.dungeon_18_level_12_text�And hello to all heroes from the famous French baguette master and Minecraft World Champion! Even drunk he does not see you as a threat.dungeon_18_level_21_text�Moin moin, hello and welcome to your spanking. "Now you're due like animal furs" he roars triumphantly at you because with his bad puns and "like" comparisons he will beat you up like an interior decorator.all_dungeons_are_locked_titleAll dungeons are lockedall_dungeons_are_locked_text�There are no more dungeons open at the moment. You need a dungeon key to open a dungeon:<br>See what you need to do to find more dungeon keys!dungeon_18_level_01_text!Only a true bully can defeat him!dungeon_18_level_02_textnWhile you are looking at the next tube, you catch sight of a horned opponent grinning and predicting your end.dungeon_18_level_04_texthLegend has it that his infamous hair and monkey business will be your downfall. Engage at your own risk.dungeon_18_level_06_text�The blue-haired guy is afraid of spiders, but since you don't have eight legs, you'll have to bite the dust! Welcome to your demise!dungeon_18_level_07_text\According to the current trend cocky heroes can be easily defeated with these clever tricks!dungeon_18_level_10_text5Unbeaten so far, but will you be able to change that?dungeon_18_level_11_textOThe best known among the unknown. Not even his shadow knows who he actually is.dungeon_18_level_16_texttRumor has it this monster was born with three legs and raised in an ashtray. Remove your socks before looking at it!dungeon_18_level_17_textRThis zebra-human hybrid loves to laugh at its own jokes and your combat challenge.dungeon_18_level_18_textuYour already square-shaped eyes haven't escaped his notice. It's inconvenient that your pause button has just broken.dungeon_18_level_20_text}Help! A computer scientist! Be careful. If he gets root access, he'll fragment you to the last bit. This opponent is NP-hard.dungeon_18_level_19_textRThe King of the Incompetent is not a king for nothing, so you'd better kneel down!bard_info_damage3The Bard's harp increases damage<br>during a fight. damage_attribute_explanation_new(= 武器ダメージ *%3 (1 + %1 / 10)%2)damage_attribute_explanation_assassin_new*= (ダメージ L + R) *%3 (1 + %1 / 10)%2damage_attribute_explanation&= 武器ダメージ * (1 + %1 / 10)%2%damage_attribute_explanation_assassin0= (ダメージ L + R) * 0.625 * (1 + %1 / 10)%2druid_info_bear_text�In bear form you can neither evade nor perform a swoop. However, your critical hit chance and critical damage bonus are highly increased. After one round in bear form, you transform back into your normal form.character_idCharacter IDdungeon_18_level_15_textWIf you think he had a different hair color the last time you saw him, you may be right.dungeon_18_level_14_textxHe only asks one thing of you: you mustn't laugh! You think it's easy, but when you press play, he suddenly attacks you!dungeon_18_level_13_text~Dissatisfied, he raises his head above the monitor! You have interrupted his game! Suddenly the room becomes strangely square.dungeon_18_level_09_text�He will blind you with his perfectly shaved head, and then then blow you away with his stylish moves. You won't survive this dance!dungeon_18_level_08_textwUnderneath the thick layer of skin hides a good heart. If you bring him a packet of donuts, he might even let you pass.dungeon_18_level_05_textlStrike all you want, but he's a master of royal clashes and knows every trick to break your fighting spirit.dungeon_18_level_03_text^New technologies are on his side. Try to defeat him with your inferior equipment, if you dare!nav_mushroom_timeまたは %1nav_mushroom_or_hourglass_time%1 あるいはnav_hourglass_time%1 あるいはcharacter_verification_tooltip(Official Shakes & Fidget Content Creatorquest_text_location_5影山へ向かえ。bard_tutorial_text_1�As a Bard, you deal your damage in combat depending on the level of your <info>intelligence</info> attribute. You also play your harp every %1 combat rounds. The melody that your harp plays gives you a positive effect in battle.<br><br>Your melody will be ineffective in fights against <info>Mages</info>!update_required_titleUpdate requiredupdate_required_text�Please update the app as it is not possible to continue playing without an update.<br><br>Would you like to download the update now?<br><br>This will close the app!update_recommended_text{A new update is ready for you to install.<br><br>Would you like to download the update now?<br><br>This will close the app!update_recommended_titelUpdate possibledruid_info_eagle_text�The eagle form gives you the chance to land a swoop attack instead of a normal attack, dealing a lot of damage. Each swoop increases this chance.druid_info_shapes_titleShapeshiftingdruid_info_eagle_titleSwoop of the Eagle
max_chanceMaximum chance: %1bard_instrument_titleハープ：活力の音色druid_info_bear_titleBear in Ragedruid_info_crittThe Druid's Bear Form affects<br>the maximum critical hit chance in fights<br>and the damage bonus of critical hits.dive_attack_chance_increaseChance increase: %1bard_instrument_2_text4<info>武器ダメージ</info>を増加させる。dot_misc_wizard_15You hear vicious growling.dot_boss_38_Helps such poor unfortunate souls like you quite unselfishly as long as you pay with your life!dot_monster_wizard_87Hopefully, you've perfected the swish and flick by now?monster_name_6069Natural Narcissistspet_requirements_water_19XCan be found on a<br>quest in the Busted Lands<br>after clearing the 22nd Light Dungeon.pet_requirements_light_19KCan be found on a<br>quest in the Rotten Lands<br>after clearing the Tower.pet_requirements_fire_19LCan be found on a<br>quest on Skull Island after<br>clearing Demon's Portal.pet_requirements_shadow_19hCan be found in the Plains of Oz'Korr<br>after clearing floor 10 of the<br>15th dungeon in Shadow World.tower_bonus_info+%1% gold bonus (quests)tower_explanation�100 floors are waiting for you to climb them.<br><br>For each floor you defeat, you will receive a permanent bonus of +1% gold for quests.<br><br>After completing the 100th floor, you will receive a permanent bonus of +100% gold!monster_name_5236Ice-cold Morticianmonster_name_5237 Uschi, Contract Mage of the Seasmonster_name_5238Shadow Witch of Crossbowsmonster_name_5239Baba Yaga's Holiday Hutmonster_name_5230Gargling Cauldronmonster_name_5231Ultrasensitive Unicorn Dummymonster_name_5232One-legged Assistantmonster_name_5233Magical Kittymonster_name_5234Sharp-tongued Marsh Toadmonster_name_5235Clamoring Mandrakeitem_type_09_pic_106nBaba Yaga's Cursed Claw Ring|"Upset clucking didn't help here, but this<br>ring will serve you well. BA-GAWK!"item_type_03_class_1_pic_106bUschi's Kraken Dress|"For the most graceful locomotion both on<br>land and on the deepest seabed."gt_greed_1_titlePlain of Blind Greedgt_greed_1_desc�Many a person has voluntarily thrown themselves into the lava flow of molten gold here. Alternatively, you can go and break your neck jumping into the glittering pool of coins.gt_gluttony_2_titlePlain of Palatable Booze-houndsgt_gluttony_2_desc�The music is so loud here that you have to yell and belch in each other's ears and still understand nothing. Besides, everything seems to be spinning here.monster_name_6076Crusty Crustaceanmonster_name_6077Furry She-Devilmonster_name_6065Filterless Natural Beautymonster_name_6066Power-hungry Regentmonster_name_6067Brutal Brokermonster_name_6068Greedy Gold Divermonster_name_6070The Deluded Richmonster_name_6071
Vain Elitemonster_name_6072Ruthless Collectorsmonster_name_6073Haughty Hoardersmonster_name_6074Greedy Groupmonster_name_6075Powerful Packalbum_ach_067_textAStart December 6th without shoes. Put them in the inventory, e.g.dot_misc_wizard_6CAre you wrong or did the portrait just stick its tongue out at you?dot_boss_37BShe always has several cold hands ready for your colorless demise.dot_boss_39\Choose your death: strangled by hair, pierced by arrows or rather crushed by a demonic foot?dot_boss_40uCuckoo knows why this hut bares its teeth hungrily at the sight of you. Make sure it makes its last chirp right away!dot_monster_wizard_6.Abracadabra! But will you get ahead unscathed?dot_monster_wizard_7How good are you at apparating?dot_monster_wizard_9AIf you master sleight of hand, this is the wrong audience for it.dot_monster_wizard_10-Can perhaps be bribed with a chocolate bunny?dot_misc_wizard_100Something is clucking and cooing here, isn't it?dot_misc_wizard_7FPicking your nose is not recommended with all those eyes watching you.dot_misc_wizard_8-The screaming mandrakes make your ears bleed.dot_misc_wizard_9AA chant of words you have never heard before pierces the silence.dot_misc_wizard_11QJudging by the smell of sulfur, some eggs from last year have not been found yet.dot_misc_wizard_12$Is something boiling over somewhere?dot_misc_wizard_13=Sounds like sharp fingernails slowly scratching a chalkboard.dot_misc_wizard_14&Is someone nibbling on a child's bone?dot_misc_wizard_167Hysterical female laughter echoes through the corridor.dot_misc_wizard_17:Throbbing and knocking can be heard from some Easter eggs.dot_misc_wizard_188Hissing, a scaled reptile is slithering along your feet.dot_misc_wizard_19?Is anyone sweeping? The dusty corridors are in dire need of it.dot_misc_wizard_208A soothing flute melody makes your eyelids feel heavier.dot_misc_wizard_21=Because of the permanent hocus-pocus, you start seeing stars.dot_misc_wizard_3IBetter close your mouth or you'll end up swallowing the flying gold ball!dot_intro_easter�On this year's quest for the magical Legendaries you have ended up in the enchanted forest. Fight your way through cursed branches and defeat the powerful coven!item_type_09_pic_105AElven Ring|"Not THE ring, but you hereby<br>become its sidekick."item_type_06_class_1_pic_105jSun Helmet|"This practical helmet not only<br>blinds your opponent, but pokes<br>his eyes out right away!"item_type_10_pic_105bUseless Sword|"Transforms into a handy key<br>for your new home with just<br>a few drops of blood.gt_visual_rewardlEveryone in your guild receives a character background <portraitbg>. It will last until the next Hellevator.payment_in_progress_alreadyUAnother payment process is already in progress.<br>Please wait until it is completed.event_description_valentineS<li>Chance of amorous epic items in the weapon shop, magic shop and for quests</li>worldWorlddump_allDump allitem_type_11_pic_043;Flying Key|"To catch him, you must get on your broom first"dungeon_26_commentM「1体が逃げだすたびに<br>どこかの都市が火に包まれる」dungeon_19_commentjラグナロクがビフレストに震動をも<br>たらすまで打ちのめされるという考え。dot_reward_textOYou have found one item. Decide what you want to do with it before you move on. event_description_epic_adventurew<li>You will receive an epic item each for completing the second adventure after drinking the first and tenth beer</li>starterpack_9_christmas_titleChristmas Elf Packitem_type_10_pic_068WSweet Temptation|"Give it away or tearfully eat it yourself."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!dot_mode_selection_textQThe choice is yours!<br>Choose a Legendary Dungeon mode and grab Legendary items!item_type_07_class_3_pic_068>Heart Cord|"Become a gift yourself."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!claim_legendary_rewards_textRHey scatterbrain! Don't forget to claim your Legendary items before it's too late!"dot_ultimate_mode_description_pt_2[<li><info>3x the amount of resources</info></li><li><info>3x the amount of gold</info></li>monster_name_5218Christmas Trollmonster_name_5219
Snow Snakemonster_name_5220Wolf Pigmonster_name_5221
Puggy Wargmonster_name_5222Orc Glow Nosemonster_name_5223Powdered Orcmonster_name_5224Christmas Party Orcmonster_name_5225Exhausted Screenwriterdot_standard_mode_description�Mysterious doors, nasty monsters and powerful bosses await you in this mode. But in the end you will receive <info>a Legendary item</info> for all your efforts!"dot_ultimate_mode_description_pt_1xOnly for particularly efficient treasure hunters! <info>Chests, monsters</info> and <info>special rooms</info> grant you"dot_ultimate_mode_description_pt_3aYou will also get <info>3 Legendary items</info> after defeating the final boss in the last room.dot_multi_reward_textQYou have found %1 items. Decide what you want to do with them before you move on.event_name_valentineValentine's Blessingitem_type_06_class_1_pic_068�Helmet of Rose-Colored Vision|"With this helmet even the most horrible<br>opponent suddenly looks quite lovely."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_06_class_2_pic_068SLove Antennas|"Ideal for locating distracted love dorks."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_06_class_3_pic_068CRuby Hood|"To steal hearts and sow love."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_04_class_1_pic_068�Love Kicks|"Clomp your opponents into the ground and leave a<br>heart-shaped sole print on their stunned face."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_04_class_2_pic_068PHeart Shoes|"With these shoes you walk on cloud nine."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_04_class_3_pic_068fInspiring Boots|"With the power of love only your<br>pride stands in your way." - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_03_class_1_pic_068�Steel Plates of the Strengthened Heart|"True love won't protect you from heartache,<br>but these steel plates will." - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_03_class_3_pic_068sSmooth Negligé|"Certainly protects you from many things, but not from<br>passionate looks". - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_05_class_1_pic_068kHeart Beaters|"Love must be shared, and these gloves spread<br>it with every punch." - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_05_class_2_pic_068XTasteful Gloves|"Protects your hands from melting chocolates."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_05_class_3_pic_068`Love Spiral|"All that glitters is not gold, but there is<br>love inside." - XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_07_class_2_pic_068QLove Potion Leather Strap|"For the pragmatic romantic."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_02_class_1_pic_068VShield of Intimate Distance|"Keeps any pushy suitor at bay."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_01_class_1_pic_068YHeart Cleaver|"Makes the hearts of your opponents beat faster."<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_01_class_2_pic_068\Love Scepter|"Shoots a hot beam of love that will melt any<br>heart." - XOXO your Valentine!item_type_01_class_3_pic_068eEmotional Explosion|"Let it rain hearts. Attention: danger of suffocation!"<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!item_type_08_pic_068aHalf-hearted Confession of Love|"Forever separated or forever coupled?"<br>- XOXO Your Valentine!event_name_salechristmasChristmas Saleevent_name_salenewyearNew Year's Salestarterpack_12_newyear_titleFireworks Packstarterpack_10_christmas_titleChristmas Tree Packstarterpack_11_christmas_titleChristmas Feast Packnot_enough_inventory_space-Your backpack doesn't have enough free space.claim_legendary_rewards_titleClaim Legendary items!dungeon_24_commentX「ここでは公式のヒーロー免許証がそそく<br>さと確認される…」	worlds_euEuropegt_daily_bonus_effectqAll <info>treats</info> have an additional effect of <info>+%1%</info> more damage which they add to your weapon.shop_reroll_button新商品 (1<mushroom>)%blacksmith_label_removestone_possible8<white>宝石の抽出</white><br>コスト:<br>%1<br>%2ultimate_mode_name)<ultimate quote>Ultimate</ultimate quote>%fort_building_dialog_text_can_harvestF%1<br><br><info>費用：</info><br>%2<br><br><info>期間：</info>%3dot_boss_33*Spits fire and bars about Mom's spaghetti.monster_name_5227The Not That Strange Onemonster_name_5229Experimental Chefdot_boss_36}Take an ancient legacy, four drops of blood and a pinch of betrayal, and he already has the perfect recipe for your downfall.dot_boss_34LHe saw in the stars that he has to fight you. However, he has forgotten why.dot_boss_35QWarms the hearts of little orcs, but looking at him will only get you chilblains.reroll_button新商品 (%1<mushroom>)monster_name_5228
